  "fullDescription": "Romelle is a modern luxury serif typeface crafted with elegance, contrast, and timeless sophistication in mind. Designed for high-end branding, fashion editorials, logo design, beauty packaging, and premium visual identities, Romelle blends classic serif beauty with a contemporary editorial touch.\n\nIts refined curves, sharp contrast, and stylish letterforms create a bold yet graceful presence, making it perfect for designers who want to elevate their projects with a premium aesthetic.\n\nWhether you’re creating fashion logos, magazine layouts, perfume branding, boutique packaging, or social media campaigns, Romelle delivers a polished and luxurious visual impact.\n\nPerfect For:\nLuxury Branding\nFashion Logos\nBeauty & Cosmetic Packaging\nEditorial Design\nMagazine Headlines\nJewelry Branding\nBoutique Hotel Identity\nWedding Stationery\nSocial Media Templates\nProduct Packaging\nFont Features:\nUppercase & Lowercase\nNumbers & Punctuation\nMultilingual Support\nLigatures\nAlternates\nPUA Encoded\nEasy Installation\nWorks on Mac & Windows\n\nRomelle is more than just a typeface — it’s a statement of elegance, luxury, and modern refinement.",
